This licence covers the code and documents written for ano-mp in this
repository. It does not cover the third-party software ano-mp is built on
or links (JUCE, FFmpeg, TagLib, Signalsmith Stretch, and the Rust crates and
npm packages it depends on), which keep their own licences, listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

In particular, JUCE is licensed under the AGPLv3 or the commercial JUCE
licence. A build of ano-mp links JUCE, so whoever distributes one needs a
commercial JUCE licence of their own, or must distribute it under the AGPLv3.
